+// requested slice) binary of the CORRECT format previously passed staging
+// and resolver validation undetected. This section adds real architecture
+// parsing so both call sites can enforce the exact requested arm64/x64,
+// mirrored in plain JS at scripts/stage-native-deps.mjs and
+// scripts/open-design/stage.mjs (which run under plain node and cannot
+// import this .ts module directly).
