Closes the two remaining locally-repairable findings from the post-5a8
review pair (P2/P3 in the general audit, P2 findings 3-4 in the test
audit); the better_sqlite3.node architecture validation, non-circular
Windows guardian scenario coverage, stale CRLF comments, and fail-closed
read-only packaging hardening from the prior uncommitted tranche were
independently re-verified against both audit reports and preserved as-is.

- apps/desktop/package.json: add check:build (npm run build && npm run
  postbuild), auto-discovered by desktop-node22-checks.yml so OD-13's
  build/postbuild requirement actually runs under Node 22 in an enabled
  CI lane, not only the disabled Node-26 e2e-desktop.yml.
- .github/workflows/e2e-desktop.yml: pin Node via node-version-file:
  .nvmrc instead of a bare 26, so re-enabling this lane can never
  silently reintroduce a Node-26 desktop build.
- apps/desktop/scripts/node-version-policy.test.mjs: watch e2e-desktop.yml
  for Node-version drift regardless of its enabled/disabled state, and
  assert an enabled lane runs both build and postbuild.
- apps/desktop/docs/open-design-integration.verification.json: replace
  the scope-manifest-only report with an explicit OD-01..OD-13 result
  table (implemented-locally / pending-downstream-composition /
  in-progress per criterion, with evidence file refs), and record
  Windows real-host execution as explicitly waived-by-user rather than
  passed or silently pending.
- apps/desktop/docs/open-design-integration.amendment-1.json (new):
  on-branch provenance record for the OD-02 full-signed-app staging
  decision, equivalent to sibling commit 558e9c801 which is not an
  ancestor of this branch.
- apps/desktop/docs/open-design-integration.md: link the verification
  report and the amendment.
- apps/desktop/scripts/open-design/verification-report.test.mjs (new):
  contract tests asserting the per-criterion table covers every frozen
  contract criterion with an honest status, evidence refs resolve to
  real files, the Windows waiver is recorded, and the amendment/doc
  links exist.

Local Node 22 gate matrix run from apps/desktop (all green): typecheck;
lint --quiet; test:open-design (431 passed, 18 skipped); test:desktop:platforms
(1937 passed, 20 skipped); build; postbuild; test:open-design:live (real
signed Open Design 0.20.0 headless smoke, graceful shutdown, zero
residue). actionlint on the changed workflow: clean. git diff --check:
clean. Added-line secret/eval/shell/unsafe-HTML scan: clean. No Windows-
only command was run or claimed to have run.
